---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Joe Saia"
  description="Engineering and data leader. PhD economist. 15 years building software, data, and the teams behind them in healthtech and startups."
  wide
>
  <section class="space-y-16">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_320px]">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">
            Engineering and data leadership
          </p>
          <h1
            class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-heading sm:text-5xl"
          >
            Joe Saia
          </h1>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <p class="text-xl leading-relaxed text-text-primary">
            Engineering and data leader building software, data systems, and
            teams for high-stakes, high-growth environments.
          </p>
          <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            I'm a PhD economist who has spent 15 years building across startups,
            healthtech, AI, and data infrastructure. I'm interested in teams
            that combine intellectual depth, practical execution, and meaningful
            impact.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 pt-2">
          <a
            href="/writing/"
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded bg-btn-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-text-heading transition-colors hover:bg-btn-bg-hover"
          >
            Read the Blog
          </a>
          <a
            href="/contact/"
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded border border-border px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:border-border-hover"
          >
            Get in Touch
          </a>
          <a
            href="/resume/"
            class="inline-flex items-center rounded px-1 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-text-secondary transition-colors hover:text-text-heading"
          >
            View Resume
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface-raised p-2">
        <img
          src="/images/joe-saia-headshot.jpg"
          alt="Joe Saia"
          width="900"
          height="1125"
          class="aspect-4/5 w-full rounded-xl object-cover"
        />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <dl
      class="grid gap-5 border-y border-border py-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5"
    >
      <div>
        <dt class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-heading">15 years</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Building software and data systems
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-heading">PhD</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Columbia economist
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-heading">Research</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Economic modeling, Bayesian methods, and causal inference
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-heading">25 people</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Engineering and data org leadership
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt class="text-2xl font-semibold text-text-heading">AI + data</dt>
        <dd class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          Production systems in healthtech and startups
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>

    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-3">
        <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">
          Working thesis
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-text-heading">
          What I look for in the work, and the teams doing it.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
        <article class="rounded-lg border border-border p-6">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-accent">01</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-medium text-text-heading">
            Teams with real leverage
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            Great teams become more than the sum of their parts through hiring,
            ways of working, and the trust that lets people argue and ship
            anyway. I've led a 25-person engineering and data org, worked inside
            a global four-person team punching far above its weight, and served
            on a corporate Senior Leadership Team.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-lg border border-border p-6">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-accent">02</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-medium text-text-heading">
            Work that matters
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            I want to help build things that improve the world. That has meant
            public-sector research, work on systems-level economic questions,
            and healthtech products that improve individual lives.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-lg border border-border p-6">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-accent">03</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-medium text-text-heading">
            Colleagues with depth and range
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            I've gone deep on theory through a Columbia PhD, Bayesian research,
            and causal inference, then wide on practice by building data
            infrastructure, ML pipelines, and engineering teams across seed,
            Series A, and growth-stage companies.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="rounded-lg border border-border p-6">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-accent">04</p>
          <h3 class="mt-3 text-lg font-medium text-text-heading">
            Pragmatic AI
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
            I've built AI tools embedded in production applications, including
            triage assistants, and I'm excited by the shift underway. I'm also
            realistic about today's limits and interested in how teams reshape
            work around what should be automated and what should stay human.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface-raised px-6 py-8 sm:px-8"
    >
      <div
        class="flex flex-col gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"
      >
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-primary">
          If that describes a team you're building — or one you'd want to put me
          in touch with — let's talk.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/contact/"
          class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded bg-btn-bg px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-text-heading transition-colors hover:bg-btn-bg-hover"
        >
          Get in Touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
